            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">Inventory refers to the distribution of 1 kg of palm methyl ester (PME) in Switzerland. PME is imported from Malaysia and produced from palm oil. Distribution to the final consumer (service station) including all necessary transports.;
Formula: C17H33O3; 
Synonyms: XME, PME, biodiesel, bio-diesel; 
UUID: a048cc46-075e-3aa3-a738-7e9a168751f9</common:generalComment>
